X11: Restore IME focus after replacing the active window's input context

Author: ssy (shim9610)
License: Apache-2.0 (winit)
Upstream proposal: https://github.com/rust-windowing/winit/pull/4727
Source revision: https://github.com/shim9610/winit/commit/6df8b561b2a9e59cfa6d739fe631f87c3b78ae5b
